  "body": "## [0.39.1](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/compare/v0.39.0...v0.39.1) (2026-09-14)\n\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n* **deps:** update docs ([#2226](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/issues/2226)) ([8c78fa5](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/commit/8c78fa54a1d2742d6bdfa9c1c8c1c0d4af16d0e6))\n* **security/high/dagger:** update module google.golang.org/grpc to v1.83.2 [security] ([#2233](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/issues/2233)) ([c4a243d](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/commit/c4a243d4c41817d9d5478c32526d4d75070131ed))\n* **security/high/:** update module google.golang.org/grpc to v1.83.2 [security] ([#2232](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/issues/2232)) ([a0b57b3](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/commit/a0b57b39de38d2a0335926a45a3abe03793a043f))\n* **security/unknown/:** update module golang.org/x/crypto to v0.56.0 [security] ([#2231](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/issues/2231)) ([b8d321a](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/commit/b8d321a1bff991a98334f9e64c8772f07c467aa5))\n\n\n### 🔧 Miscellaneous Chores\n\n* **deps:** update dependency pnpm to v11.23.0 ([#2224](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/issues/2224)) ([b566241](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/commit/b5662410d958eccb5c37b2bcae0ae955af87c7d8))\n* **deps:** update go toolchain directive to v1.27.1 ([#2205](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/issues/2205)) ([656b164](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/commit/656b16426961e1400c11443112d8deb4a3c2f31d))\n* **deps:** update k8s.io/kube-openapi digest to be32def ([#2216](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/issues/2216)) ([cbcad63](https://github.com/grafana/tanka/commit/cbcad63c3152e471a07c4a06280b00cb876feedd))"
